      "https://media.rawg.io/media/resize/640/-/screenshots/7d9/7d9f94ab54a88653a58378956e572840.jpg",
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/resize/640/-/screenshots/ee2/ee2329bbfdefab9ad385f43db83862b4.jpg"
    ],
    "summary": "The most challenging game on Earth comes to life in Battle Chess. An entire medieval world at war is reflected on the checkered field.\nEveryone who's ever had a knight take a pawn, has seen that capture as more than one piece replacing another on the board. In players' minds, the bold knight, resplendent in his armor of silver or ebon, sallies forth and slays the foul foot soldier. Combat, mortal combat, lies in the heart and soul of chess, but this aspect of it could only live in the mind's eye – until now!\nIt took 2000 years for someone to make chess better!\nThis is an entertainment that will prove the words of the famous Oriental Philosopher Chef Kung Pao who said - \"War is fun!\"\nAmusing chess piece animations\nA challenging AI with over 30,000 moves",
    "developer": "Interplay Entertainment",
    "reviews": []
  },
